() '
(Our litigation advisory committee outlines the strategic roadmap for) '
(appellate oral argument and potential structured mediation:) '
() '
(- Focus oral argument on the absence of empirical irreparable harm) '
(evidence on the record.) '
() '
(- Request alternative relief: Narrow the geographic scope of the) '
(injunction to single-state boundaries.) '
() '
(- File an emergency motion for stay pending appeal under Federal) '
(Rule of Appellate Procedure 8.) '
() '
(- Prepare parallel mediation terms establishing a paid royalty) '
(licensing framework to terminate exposure.) '
() '
